          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Consider the set $A,$ defined as\n\n$$\nA = \\left \\{ 4^n : n \\in \\mathbb Z,\\, -2\\leq n\\leq 2  \\right \\}.\n$$\n\nDescribe $A$ by listing all of its elements.",
